  "metaRegistry": "https://w3id.org/ogc/bblocks/meta-register.json",
  "name": "Building Blocks - Portolan Building Blocks",
  "abstract": "OGC Building Blocks for the [Portolan specification](https://github.com/portolan-sdi/portolan-spec):\nthe Portolan STAC profile and the STAC extensions Portolan defines.\n",
  "description": "Portolan is an open specification for cloud-native geospatial data catalogs. Every Portolan\ncatalog is a static STAC catalog on plain HTTPS object storage, with cloud-native assets and\nguidance files that both people and AI agents read.\n\nThis register wraps the published Portolan artifacts as Building Blocks. It does not redefine\nthem. The schema of record is `https://schemas.portolan-sdi.org/portolan/<version>/schema.json`,\nthe profile text lives in `portolan-spec/stac/README.md`, and rules the schema cannot express are\nchecked by the [rashid](https://github.com/portolan-sdi/rashid) validator.\n",
  "modified": "2026-11-24T00:57:01.208370",
  "tooling": {
    "bblocks-postprocess": {
      "commitId": "\"990affbe72a10408bfed51a6254103fad13752c2",
      "shortCommitId": "\"990aff",
      "date": "2026-11-19T17:39:46+00:00\""
    }
  },
